# Module Structure

Every feature module MUST follow this exact structure (see [auth module](mdc:src/modules/auth) as reference):

```
src/modules/[feature]/
├── __tests__/
│   ├── [feature].api.test.ts      # API client tests
│   ├── [feature]Slice.test.ts     # Redux slice tests
│   └── [Component].test.tsx        # Component tests
├── interfaces/
│   ├── [feature].interface.ts     # Type definitions
│   └── index.ts                    # Export barrel
├── reducers/
│   └── [feature]Slice.ts          # Redux slice
├── hooks/
│   └── use[Feature].ts            # Custom hooks
├── components/
│   └── [Feature]Modal.tsx         # Modal components
├── pages/
│   └── [Feature]List.tsx          # Page components
└── [feature].api.ts               # API client
```

## Required Files
1. ✅ `interfaces/[feature].interface.ts` - All types and interfaces
2. ✅ `[feature].api.ts` - Extends BaseApi
3. ✅ `reducers/[feature]Slice.ts` - Redux slice with thunks
4. ✅ `hooks/use[Feature].ts` - Custom hook wrapping Redux
5. ✅ `pages/[Feature]List.tsx` - Main list page with table
6. ✅ `components/[Feature]Modal.tsx` - Details/form modal
7. ✅ `__tests__/` - Tests for ALL above files

## Integration Checklist
After creating module files:
- [ ] Register reducer in [src/store/index.ts](mdc:src/store/index.ts)
- [ ] Add route in [src/routes/index.tsx](mdc:src/routes/index.tsx)
- [ ] Add sidebar link in [src/modules/layout/AppSidebar.tsx](mdc:src/modules/layout/AppSidebar.tsx)
- [ ] Write tests for all components
- [ ] Verify API integration with backend
